{"unit_id":"devkaij__dsh-session-recycle-bin#card-zh","repo":"devkaij/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"7f3d215bede7c9c9b303039a4ab6e136a0635645","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 是 DSH Web 的会话与定时任务回收站。它提供 /recycle 命令及侧边栏面板，可将条目移入回收站、查看、恢复会话到原位置，或确认后彻底清除；过期条目按保留期清理。适合需要找回误删会话或管理自动化任务的用户。无需 API 密钥，数据保存在本机；定时任务功能要求宿主启用 schedule 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:103-119","lib/index.js:1401-1404","lib/client.js:26-60","lib/index.js:45-54"]}
{"unit_id":"devkaij__dsh-session-recycle-bin#card-en","repo":"devkaij/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"7f3d215bede7c9c9b303039a4ab6e136a0635645","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin adds a recycle bin for DSH sessions and scheduled tasks. Use /recycle or the sidebar panel to browse and restore entries, or permanently delete them after confirmation. Data stays local; scheduled-task support requires the host schedule service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:103-119","lib/index.js:1401-1404","lib/client.js:26-60","lib/index.js:45-54"]}
